"The sentence pre-filled into the contact note when a call is logged from "
"this step, e.g. 'We followed up with the section and they advised the file "
"is under review'."
msgstr "راجعنا الشعبة وأفادوا بأن المعاملة قيد التدقيق"

#. module: legal_procedure
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/legal_procedure/static/src/components/desk/legal_desk.js:0
#: code:addons/legal_procedure/static/src/components/mail_room/legal_mail_room.js:0
msgid ""
"The server could not be reached, or it reported an error. Nothing you did "
"caused this."
msgstr ""
"تعذر الوصول إلى الخادم، أو أنه أبلغ عن خطأ. ولم يكن شيء مما فعلته سببًا في "
"ذلك."

#. module: legal_procedure
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_procedure.field_legal_procedure_phase__kind
